# THE FRONTEND COMMIT THIS BACKEND CARRIES (ArgonFinancials/Argon_Cooperative_Frontend).
#
# One commit is one deployed state, across two repositories. The frontend job
# (.github/workflows/deploy.yml) builds exactly this commit as a static export
# on every push, and the deploy ships it in the same release archive as the
# backend. A frontend push deploys nothing until a backend commit moves this
# line: the backend is the thing that gets deployed, and the frontend is part
# of what it carries. Moving it is reviewed and tested like any other change.
#
# One full 40-character commit id; lines starting with # are comments.
# b299a85: the static export (output: "export", ?id= routes), 2026-11-18.
